<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (What if these symptoms are not isolated problems, but signs of a broader structural condition? What if the defining challenge of modern enterprises is no longer capability, but coherence?)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
