/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (This manuscript explores a simple but increasingly important question: How do organisations continue moving coherently as complexity continues to expand? The answer may be more important than many leaders realise.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
